;    1: TDecorate(count=521, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=9, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=235, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=91, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=10, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=9, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=けんか, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=けんか, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=1309, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=すもも, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=39, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=45, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=4584, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=4232, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\The_Covert.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Only <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> and I remained in the storehouse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I just hoped she wouldn't get in my way...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had a really scary look on her face."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, her bright smile of a moment ago was gone, and her face turned sad and lonely.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, what's wrong...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see... You're worried about her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> been acting cheerful on purpose, after seeing <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE> face?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The truth was, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> must have been hurting enough to cry, too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, can I stay with you a little longer? I won't get in the way..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Yeah, sure."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... thanks."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The corners of <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan's</STYLE> mouth lifted, just a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> sat down beside me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I really won't get in the way..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, why sit by me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Obaasan</STYLE> and her <STYLE ID="6">dad</STYLE> must be around too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, do you and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> get along?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... I love </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... this past New Year's, we had a </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="けんか">fight</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. It was the first time we ever had a </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="けんか">fight</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> like that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and I made up when she went back to Tokyo, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see. It hurts when you and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> get in a </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="けんか">fight</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... But now it hurts even more..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But the people of the settlement are looking for </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　So I'm sure they'll find her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The grown-ups say '</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was probably curse-killed.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So it looks like they've already given up... And seeing that hurts too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So there's a gap between how <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> feels and how the people around her feel.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If everyone treats <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> as dead, of course it hurts.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> told me. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you went all the way to Tokyo to hear her out, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, she said she had a problem."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was really grateful to you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Up until yesterday, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was working so hard it looked rough on her, but somehow she seemed happy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So... thank you."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\夢見る憧憬.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I hadn't expected to be thanked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was able to pin down the truth probably because my advice helped a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But when you trace it back, it's because she followed my advice that <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> disappeared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know well enough that blaming myself like this is wrong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But when I see <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> looking so sad...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, why do you look sad?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? No... it's nothing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it showed on my face...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now all kinds of feelings are jumbled up inside me, and I can't make sense of them.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, can I call you Eri-nee?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Eri-nee?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You helped </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, didn't you? So you're a really important person too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If everyone calls </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> '</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">,' then I'll..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Yeah... sure."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Aha! Thanks, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死にかけ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> threw her arms around me and hugged me tight.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, thank you. You can solve the curse-killings for sure, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will turn up too, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, it'll be fine, I'm sure. That's what we came here for."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I said I wouldn't get in the way... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll go get </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> dinner from the house!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> hurried off down the stairs.<PG>
By rights, I'd meant to keep our investigation of the curse-killings hidden from <STYLE ID="5">Obaasan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, but now that we've gotten this much information, there's probably no need for that anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
They should need our help, both to solve the curse-killings and to search for <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now then... before I continue the investigation, let me sum up what we have so far.<PG>
There were a lot of books here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And among them was one that caught my attention.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a scripture of sorts, written in Japanese.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The title reads 'The Teachings of Cerejeira'.<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> must have brought it here as an important book for some reason.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\BGM_212.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\新約聖書日本語.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Cerejeira―I've heard of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I remember right, a regional religion called the Holy Cerejeira Church that started in Megasawa City.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's almost died out now, apparently, but until a few decades ago it flourished enough to make Megasawa City a religious city, or so I've heard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But this book is in a very old style; I'd guess it's at least 400 years old.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why would a scripture of a religion born in Megasawa be in a place like this―and an old one, at that?<PG>
I can think of several possible reasons, but the most likely is that people from the Arata settlement started the religion in Megasawa City.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Geographically, the two aren't that far apart either, so I can safely put this forward as a hypothesis.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For now, the deduction can wait. Let me read it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "悪天候.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">After a long sea voyage, Lord Sele reached this land of Japan, and the land of Arata.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">For generations, Lord Sele's family had governed a colony, appointed to the task by the homeland.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Thus Lord Sele knew nothing of the homeland; this colony, it is said, was his mother country.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">But a calamity befell that mother country.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Trees of a hideous size grew, and bewitching flowers bloomed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">And the dead, led by the Fierce Sound, rose again in this world, and the mother country stood on the brink of ruin.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Lord Sele put as many companions aboard his ship as it could carry and barely escaped the mother country with his life.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">The place he reached at last was this land of Japan, and Arata.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Lord Sele was a man of deep culture and learning, and his teachings soon took root among us, the people of Arata, as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Before long, Lord Sele had become the source of our wisdom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Lord Sele changed his name to Ginosuke Niimura and spared nothing in offering his knowledge and research for Arata.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
I see―so this is when Western culture began to mix into Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But everything that supposedly happened in his mother country is strange.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Giant trees, bewitching flowers, the Fierce Sound.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's surely no doubt that a Westerner who changed his name to Ginosuke Niimura existed, but somehow it doesn't feel real.<PG>
No... the part about the dead, led by 'the Fierce Sound,' rising again in this world bothers me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The dead coming back to life―that phenomenon was in <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> voice memo too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the Fierce Sound is the trumpet-like sound we heard at Toyotake Station―<PG>
If so, this scripture is highly credible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's more, that Fierce Sound is said to be a sound of ruin, the kind called the apocalyptic sound or strange sounds.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Search for it online and you'll find any number of hits, so it's a phenomenon observed all over the world.<PG>
For now, let me read on.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Lord Sele, now Lord Ginosuke, kindly told us in detail of what happened in his mother country.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">But Lord Ginosuke himself did not know why such a disaster had occurred, and he said his account would read like a fairy tale.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">With that understood, I set it down here.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">The beautiful trees and flowers of the mother country.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">They resembled what in Japan is called the cherry, but they were also like the rose and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="すもも">plum</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">They seemed to be native to the mother country, and we called them Bonita.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Bonita means 'beautiful' in our tongue.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Bonita could be seen everywhere in the mother country, and they were loved.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Then one day, with a great earthquake and the sound of a hideous trumpet, Bonita changed beyond recognition into sinister forms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">The giant trees destroyed the towns and covered the whole sky.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">At the same time, every tree and flower other than Bonita withered away in an instant.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Nor was that all. The dead came back to life and began to slaughter the people.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">At first we too led armies against the army of the dead, but we could never have matched an army that could not die.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Then, from a volcano of brimstone, there appeared four generals of the army of the dead, called divine messengers, and their demon king―Abaddon.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">They seemed to command their army with that hideous trumpet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Every time the trumpet sounded, the dead appeared, and towns and nature were destroyed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">And that trumpet rang out so loudly that no one could tell where it was sounding from.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Moreover, the divine messengers had cunning tongues and high intelligence, and far from merely killing us, one companion after another began to defect to the army of the dead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Yes, our companions fell prey to suspicion feeding on itself, and in the end they began to kill one another.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Judging that the mother country could no longer be restored, I fled by ship and came at last to this land.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">At first I suspected even the companions aboard the ship of being spies for the army of the dead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">But to join the army of the dead, or to continue this voyage with no end in sight―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">when nothing remained but despair, was there any need to cast aside those who had chosen the voyage?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">It was a gamble, but I chose to trust them.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
It certainly does read like a fairy tale.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But some of it overlaps with what is already happening in the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not just the dead returning and the Fierce Sound―the part about people killing each other out of suspicion, too.<PG>
Come to think of it, the account of the killings in Arata 400 years ago, which <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> sent me in photos, had a similar passage.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "豊岳桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"The Fierce Sound rang out across the heavens, and the cherry blossoms danced.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">People killed one another, bathed in blood, and were cursed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">At the seventh Fierce Sound, Verde took on every sin, took her own life, and protected this land."</STYLE><PG>
Suppose I consider the cause of the apocalyptic sound in connection with these events.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When the <STYLE ID="11">Necro</STYLE> underground―<STYLE ID="11">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>―makes some kind of move, a huge shift occurs below ground, and small cracks open on the surface.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> is a living thing too, so she must carry out some kind of respiratory metabolism.</STYLE><PG>
A fungus produces water (water vapor) and carbon dioxide when it metabolizes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the carbon dioxide and water vapor that <STYLE ID="11">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> produces underground make a sound like a wind instrument as they pass through those cracks―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Let me assume that is the basic principle of the apocalyptic sound.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That would explain why the cherry tree that suddenly appeared at Toyotake Station and the apocalyptic sound came at the same moment.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
I read <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> memo over once more.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\茅萱手紙.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">The name of the 'someone' Goto-ch×× sp××× of is '</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">It is a giant organism that has been roo××× in this land of Ar××× for tens of thousands of years.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> is apparently clas×××××× as a fungus called the honey fungus, and she grows by plan×××× her spores in other li×××× things.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">In other words, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Shi×××× Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> is a par×××te.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">What looks like cher×× trees is, in fact, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> frui×××× body.</STYLE><PG>
What I can read from this―
{PAUSE ""}
'What looks like cher×× trees is, in fact, <STYLE ID="11">her</STYLE> frui×××× body.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'What looks like cherry trees is, in fact, <STYLE ID="11">her</STYLE> fruiting body.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A fruiting body means a mushroom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words... the Arata cherry is not a cherry at all, but part of <STYLE ID="11">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, disguised as one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="11">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> didn't just appear a moment ago; <STYLE ID="11">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> has been out in the open all along, as the Niimura family's cherry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This settlement has been in the palm of <STYLE ID="11">Shigatsu Youka's</STYLE> hand all along.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック2.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At Toyotake Station, with this sound, a cherry tree had suddenly appeared on the tracks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Has something happened again?<PG>
